  "_doc": "Expansion 1 (Vharlen). The ZONE EVENT BOSS for the Steamwood: the spirit of a boiling spring that has come to the boil. P1 'Simmering': a scalding cone, geysers that throw you, and rings of boiling water that roll outward one after another. P2 at 55% 'Coming to the Boil': two vents open — two players must stand on each to cap it (soak) or everyone is scalded; the cold springs at the edge heal. P3, a new health bar 'Boiled Dry': the Kettle cracks — a WHISTLE it charges (interrupt it, or the whole clearing is silenced and scalded), spinning jets of steam, and steam that follows each player. Soft enrage from 4 minutes, hard at 7.",
  "party": "Zone event, everyone nearby joins. Solo: not intended (the vent soak needs 2). 3-5: playable. 10+: intended. M5 scaling: health by players enrolled; soak need = clamp(players/5, 2, 4).",
